      {
        "id": 59307,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-06T06:33:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I find tire iron useless more times than not. It can be very useful in the right circumstances, but with regular Fixer I find myself usually a point of damage too short to really use it. I find it a little more useful with DW Fixer, even if you're using it essentially as a one shot. Took down an MDP that was at 5 HP one game, and that was pretty cool.</p>",
