      {
        "id": 59313,
        "name": "Sonvar",
        "username": "Powerhound_2000",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/powerhound_2000/{size}/1859_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-11-17T18:54:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would agree DW Fixer can be potent. &nbsp; Really it downgrades Overdrive and Charge. &nbsp; Overdrive because of the fact two equipment/Ongoings have to be destroyed so there is a lot to consider before using it. &nbsp; Charge because it's weaker due to less Mr Fixer styles or equipment out it also prevents you from playing another card of his that could be used towards Bitter Strike. &nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 82,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:35:04.725Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
